  "title": "AECOM bolsters environment and energy leadership in Europe and India region to accelerate growth",
  "summary": "Angela Mulgrew and Eloise John appointed to lead AECOM’s Europe and India environment and energy business as demand for energy transition and environmental transformation continues to grow. LONDON (11 June 2026) – AECOM, the trusted global infrastructure leader, has appointed Angela Mulgrew and Eloise John to lead its respective environment and energy divisions across Europe...",
